   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p><b>(1)</b> a kitchen tool with lots of small holes; you pour pasta into it to separate it from the hot water<br><b>(2)</b> to cook food in hot oil or butter, usually in a pan</p>\n<p>Which of the following matches the definitions (1) and (2) correctly?</p>",
