   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<div class=\"box\"><p>(1) ---- the cake for 30 minutes at 180 °C.<br>(2) You need an oven to ---- cookies.<br>(3) Potatoes can be fried, boiled or ---- with some rosemary.</p></div>\n<p>Which word can complete <b>all three</b> sentences? (Use its correct form.)</p>",
