   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<div class=\"box\"><p><b>Ask the Chef</b></p><p><i>“Dear Chef, my cakes always sink in the middle, and they are very dry. What am I doing wrong? – Ela”</i></p><p>Dear Ela, don’t open the oven door during the first twenty minutes, because cold air makes the cake sink. Also, don’t bake it for too long. Check it with a toothpick: if the toothpick comes out clean, the cake is ready. Finally, measure the flour carefully, because too much flour makes a cake dry. – Chef Okan</p></div>\n<p>Which of the following is <b>NOT</b> one of the chef’s pieces of advice?</p>",
